    "让智能体设真正的闹钟。和通知不同，闹钟会穿透静音和专注模式，响到你关掉为止" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lets the agent set a real alarm. Unlike a notification it rings through silent mode and Focus, and keeps ringing until you stop it"
